# Elixir / mix
/_build/
/deps/
/doc/
/.fetch
erl_crash.dump
*.ez
*.beam
/config/*.secret.exs
.elixir_ls/
/cover/

# EHDL / synthesis output.
#
# `*.v` is the emitted netlist, which is a build product — but the GATE is
# thirty-four hand-written Verilog testbenches under `scripts/`, and they
# were being ignored along with it. A clone of this repo had no gate at
# all: `run_tbs.sh` would emit everything, find no `tb_*.v`, and report
# nothing. Found while cutting v0.1.0-rc.1 (`notes/48`).
*.v
!priv/**/*.v
!scripts/*.v

*.json
!mix.lock
*.bit
*.svf
*.config
*.fasm
*.frames
*.vcd
*.gtkw
/build/
/out/

# generated images, netlists and reports: everything under here comes
# back from `scripts/emit_all.exs` and the mk_* generators
/_emit/

# Scratch
.scratch/
_prim/
_to_delete/
tmp_*.exs
*.log
